<title>USA: Atlantic enters agreement with Intercoin.</title>
<headline>Atlantic enters agreement with Intercoin.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic International Entertainment Ltd said on Wednesday that it entered into a license agreement with Intercoin A V V, for its Internet South African-based gaming operations.</p>
<p>The deal represents total revenues of $400,000, it said.</p>
<p>Atlantic International develops and markets Internet and private network transaction based products.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
